さるになるよ さるになるよ
I'll become a monkey... I'll become a monkey...

475
00:43:28,247 --> 00:43:31,947
さるになるよ
I'll become a monkey...

476
00:44:31,597 --> 00:44:34,297
朝まで踊る夢だけ見せて
Let me dream of dancing until dawn,

477
00:44:34,297 --> 00:44:37,597
時計の鐘が解く魔法
the magic that the clock's bell breaks.

478
00:44:37,897 --> 00:44:40,297
曖昧な指誘う階段
Vague fingers beckon me to the stairs,

479
00:44:40,297 --> 00:44:43,297
三段飛ばしに跳ねていく
leaping up three steps at a time.

480
00:44:46,297 --> 00:44:48,897
馬車の中で震えてた
Shivering inside the carriage,

481
00:44:48,897 --> 00:44:51,297
みじめな古着めくりめぐれよ
turning over miserable old clothes.

482
00:44:51,597 --> 00:44:54,297
夜の舞踏見知らぬ顔探す
Searching for unfamiliar faces at the night ball,

483
00:44:54,297 --> 00:44:57,597
囁くあの声が握りしめた
that whispering voice clenched tightly.

484
00:44:59,097 --> 00:45:01,597
刃突きだすすべてを奪えと
Pointing the blade: seize everything!

485
00:45:02,918 --> 00:45:04,218
朝まで踊る夢だけ見せて
Show me only the dream of dancing until morning

486
00:45:04,218 --> 00:45:05,718
時計の鐘が解く魔法
the magic unlocked by the clock's bell.

487
00:45:05,718 --> 00:45:07,718
曖昧な指誘う階段
The vaguely beckoning stairs,

488
00:45:07,718 --> 00:45:09,418
三段飛ばしに跳ねていく
bouncing up three steps at a time.

489
00:45:09,418 --> 00:45:12,218
すべてを奪えと
To steal everything away...

490
00:45:12,868 --> 00:45:15,418
孤児集う城
An orphanage-gathering castle,

491
00:45:15,418 --> 00:45:18,718
笑み仮面に描いて
drawn on a smiling mask.

492
00:45:18,718 --> 00:45:22,218
偽りの慈しみさえ
Even false affection...

493
00:45:22,218 --> 00:45:25,718
羽で包む熾天使
A seraph wrapped in feathers.

494
00:45:38,718 --> 00:45:41,218
灰の中で
In the ashes,

495
00:45:41,218 --> 00:45:45,718
赤く溶けて混じる
melting and mixing in red.

496
00:45:45,718 --> 00:45:48,718
硝子の靴
Glass shoes,

497
00:45:48,718 --> 00:45:50,718
今更帰る
returning now, of all times.

498
00:45:51,218 --> 00:45:54,218
震えているの
I'm trembling,

499
00:45:54,218 --> 00:45:57,718
あなたが目をやる時計
the clock you're looking at.

500
00:45:57,718 --> 00:46:01,718
靴脱ぎ踊るスロープ抜けて
Dancing off my shoes, slipping past the slope,

501
00:46:01,718 --> 00:46:04,718
喉まで伸びる指の先で
with fingertips stretching to my throat.

502
00:46:05,218 --> 00:46:11,218
すくう雫口付けて
Scooping droplets, kissing them,

503
00:46:11,218 --> 00:46:16,218
走る衝動背骨抜けていく刹那
the impulse to run piercing through my spine.

504
00:46:19,218 --> 00:46:22,218
鐘は鳴らさないで
Don't ring the bell,

505
00:46:22,218 --> 00:46:25,718
あなたにひざまずき
kneeling down before you.

506
00:46:25,718 --> 00:46:29,218
まだダメと叫んだ右手がい
My right hand screaming "not yet",

507
00:46:29,218 --> 00:46:32,218
突き刺すサヨナラ
a piercing farewell.

508
00:46:32,718 --> 00:46:38,218
消えない硝煙を香にまとう姫
A princess draped in the scent of gunpowder,

509
00:46:38,218 --> 00:46:46,218
強い瞳僕の凍った仮面ごと打ち抜く
piercing right through my gaze and frozen mask.

510
00:46:52,218 --> 00:47:05,218
今も耳にあなたの吐息が突き刺さるの遠い夢
Even now, your sigh pierces my ears in a distant dream.

511
00:47:05,218 --> 00:47:09,218
ステンドグラス越し
Through the stained glass,

512
00:47:09,218 --> 00:47:15,718
光る月が君にかぶせたベール
the shining moon placed a veil over you.

513
00:47:18,218 --> 00:47:21,218
ドレス膝で裂いて
